<title>ESTONIA: TALLINNA PLANS LITHUANIA LEASING OFFICE.</title>
<headline>TALLINNA PLANS LITHUANIA LEASING OFFICE.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tallinna Pank plans to complete the establishment of a leasing subsidiary in Vilnius at the end of May, the bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;It (the opening) is realistic at the end of May,&quot; Targo Raus, vice chairman, told Reuters.</p>
<p>Tallinna Pank opened its leasing subsidiary in Latvia at the end of last year.</p>
<p>The leasing portfolio of the Latvian subsidiary is now worth some 25 million kroons, Raus added.</p>
<p>&quot;We are satisfied with the result...it is a good result for the first three months,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
